Package: com.gokuencinar.carrierfix.rootful
Name: CarrierFix (Rootful)
Version: 0.2.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Experimental Cricket/AT&T carrier overlay diagnostic and SMS/IMS repair tool for jailbroken iOS 15-16 rootful environments. Creates and verifies a per-carrier backup before modifying the active overlay and supports one-tap restore.
Maintainer: Gokuencinar
Author: Gokuencinar
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), firmware (<< 17.0)
Conflicts: com.gokuencinar.carrierfix, com.gokuencinar.carrierfix.dopamine